# {{PROJECT_NAME}} Design System

{{PROJECT_NAME}} (codified {{DATE}} as {{DNA_NAME}}) is a {{CREATIVE_TENSION}} design system.

{{ESSENCE}}

## Non-negotiables

1. **Use canonical tokens.** Do not hardcode a value already represented in `assets/tokens.css`.
2. **One motif, one meaning.** Do not overload recurring shapes, glyphs or motion patterns.
3. **Colour is never the only cue.** Status/state/category needs a redundant channel.
4. **Respect reduced motion** on interactive surfaces; every animation needs a static equivalent.
5. **For paginated artifacts, follow `document-visual-contract.json` when present.** It overrides generic assumptions about page size, margins, furniture, pagination and document component recipes, but never invents business/content truth.

